 o Part\nFull Stage Makeup Instruction Sheet:\n• Apply foundation and p
 owder matching skintone\n• Light skin tone eye shadow over entire eye\
 n• Dark brown eye shadow over crease\n• Medium brown eye shadow blen
 ded over brown\n• Black fake eyelashes (note: apply mascara to own las
